## 16. Guest auth layers + phase checklist (locked 2026-08-16)

Five layers — Phase 1 implements A–E on **Portal only**:

| Layer | Owner | May do | Must not do |
| ----- | ----- | ------ | ----------- |
| **A** Auth UI | `catalog-registration-auth-steps.tsx` | Phone/OTP/profile chrome, call transport, `probeSession` then `onAuthenticated` | `fetch` BFF URLs, `location.assign`, intake hydrate, `portalReturn` |
| **B** Transport | `GuestAuthTransport` + `createPortalSameOriginGuestAuthTransport` | Relative `/api/public-auth/*` + `GET /api/me/profile` | Cookie `Domain`, tenant bind, CORS, absolute origin |
| **C** Session write | Portal BFF `/api/public-auth/*` | `Set-Cookie` `atour_mb_session` | Move to Marketing |
| **D** Intake | Portal register host + workspace intake step | Hydrate after session on the **page** | Run inside OTP/profile steps or the login modal |
| **E** Host continuation | `onAuthenticated` | Login assign · register modal reload · (legacy) intake hydrate | Live inside auth steps |

**Phase 1 DoD (this change):**

- Shared steps have **zero** `/api/public-auth` / `/api/me/profile` string literals
- Shared steps have **zero** `location.assign` / `hydrateCatalogRegistrationIntakeAfterSession`
- Only Portal same-origin factory exists (no unused `baseUrl` adapter)
- `/login` continuation is host `onAuthenticated` → `completeMemberLoginEgress` (probe already done)
- Register modal continuation is host `onAuthenticated` → close + reload
- Client register resume `useEffect` may still `GET /api/me/profile` — that is **host resume**, not auth-step transport
- Marketing, CORS, cookie Domain helpers, GSH builders, `apps/api` public-auth, `workspace-sdk` HTTP: **unchanged**

**Phase 2 DoD (this change) — `/login` thin host + smoke-tour cleanup:**

- `/login` mounts `data-portal-login-thin-host` (not `data-portal-login-full-page`)
- Page auto-opens the shared modal with `host="login"` and `portalReturn` (PCMS-UX-04 on modal + `<main>`)
- Page has **zero** inline phone/OTP/profile: no `PortalLoginAuthFlow`, no `data-portal-login-form-panel`, no dual-panel story+form shell
- Dismiss keeps `/login?portalReturn=…`; `[data-portal-login-host-lede]` + `[data-portal-login-host-trigger]` reopen (CSS hides lede while modal open)
- Login-host modal `onAuthenticated` → `completeMemberLoginEgress` (no `completeMemberLoginEgressAfterSession`)
- Smoke `resolveMemberLoginCatalogTourId` + optional `fetchCatalogTour` are **modal context only**; missing tour must not `notFound()`
- `/login` is not deleted (middleware `/me/*` gate). Marketing OTP / CORS / cookie Domain: **unchanged**

| Later phase | Work | Blocker |
| ----------- | ---- | ------- |
| **3** | Marketing PDP CTA vs already-registered / logged-in | PCMS-legal; product, not auth rewrite |
| **4** | Architect YES on PCMS amendment + CORS on public-auth only | Required before Marketing OTP |
| **5** | New Marketing **Portal-origin** adapter (same UI, cookie still Portal BFF) | Phase 4 |
| **6** | Retire PDP→modal-on-register as the primary logged-out buy path | Phase 5 |

Acceptance retained: *Today Portal is the only active auth host. Tomorrow Marketing can become a second auth UI host by adding a Portal-origin transport adapter and approved CORS/PCMS changes, without rewriting OTP/profile UI, creating a second auth package, moving session ownership, or changing Portal `/login`.*
